      "content": "The Ambassador is worried that having the live feed running in the background might make the team look like they can't navigate these talks without a computer's help. There's some talk about whether we should just switch to the post-session debriefs permanently if the real-time data isn't actually adding enough value to justify the \"distraction.\"",
